   "issues": [
     {"issue": "\"Without this Consent Judgment constituting evidence against Defendant\" states no limits on the proceedings or purposes for which the bar operates, so its reach (third-party suits? enforcement proceedings?) is open.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.24},
